h3 MCP
p.text-muted.mb-4(translate) Allow agents to discover Tabby connections through Model Context Protocol.

section.mcp-section
    .section-heading
        h4.mb-0(translate) Server configuration
        span.text-success(*ngIf='mcp.listenEndpoint', translate) Running
        span.text-muted(*ngIf='!mcp.listenEndpoint', translate) Stopped
    .form-line
        .header
            .title(translate) Enable MCP server
            .description(translate) Requests require a bearer token and an unlocked vault.
        toggle(#serverEnabled='ngModel', [ngModel]='mcp.settings.enabled', (ngModelChange)='setEnabled($event, serverEnabled)', [disabled]='busy')
    form.listen-settings((ngSubmit)='refreshInterfaceAddresses(); saveSettings()')
        label.listen-host-label(for='mcp-host', translate) Listen IP
        label.listen-port-label(for='mcp-port', translate) Port
        .listen-picker(ngbDropdown, display='static', (openChange)='$event && refreshInterfaceAddresses()')
            .input-group
                input#mcp-host.form-control(type='text', name='host', [(ngModel)]='host', [disabled]='busy', spellcheck='false', autocomplete='off')
                button.btn.btn-secondary(ngbDropdownToggle, type='button', [disabled]='busy', [attr.aria-label]='selectListenIPLabel | translate', aria-controls='mcp-host-options')
            #mcp-host-options.listen-options(ngbDropdownMenu)
                button.listen-option(ngbDropdownItem, type='button', [disabled]='busy', (click)='host = localHost')
                    code {{localHost}}
                    span.text-muted(translate) This computer
                button.listen-option(ngbDropdownItem, type='button', [disabled]='busy', (click)='host = ipv4Wildcard')
                    code {{ipv4Wildcard}}
                    span.text-muted(translate) All IPv4 interfaces
                button.listen-option(ngbDropdownItem, *ngFor='let entry of interfaceAddresses', type='button', [disabled]='busy', (click)='host = entry.host')
                    code {{entry.host}}
                    span.text-muted {{entry.interfaceName}}
        span.listen-separator(aria-hidden='true') :
        input#mcp-port.form-control.listen-port(type='number', name='port', min='1', max='65535', [(ngModel)]='port', [disabled]='busy', [placeholder]='automaticPortLabel | translate')
        button.btn.btn-secondary.listen-apply(type='submit', [disabled]='busy', translate) Apply
    p.text-muted.small.mb-0(translate) Select a trusted network. LAN requests use unencrypted HTTP.
    .server-address
        #mcp-address-title(aria-live='polite')
            span(*ngIf='mcp.listenEndpoint', translate) Server address
            span(*ngIf='!mcp.listenEndpoint', translate) Server address preview
        ul.address-list(aria-labelledby='mcp-address-title')
            li.address-row(*ngFor='let entry of serviceAddresses; trackBy: trackServiceAddress')
                div
                    code {{entry.url}}
                    .address-interface.text-muted.small(*ngIf='entry.interfaceName')
                        span {{entry.interfaceName}}
                        span(*ngIf='entry.isDefault', translate) Default network interface
                    div.text-muted.small(*ngIf='entry.host === localHost || entry.host === "::1"', translate) This computer
                button.btn.btn-secondary.btn-sm(type='button', *ngIf='mcp.listenEndpoint', (click)='copy(entry.url)', [attr.aria-label]='copyAddressLabel | translate: {address: entry.url}', [attr.title]='"Copy" | translate')
                    i.fas.fa-copy(aria-hidden='true')
    p.text-muted.small.mt-2.mb-0(*ngIf='wildcardHost', translate) When listening on all interfaces, connect remotely using this computer's LAN IP.
    p.text-muted.mb-0.mt-2(*ngIf='!mcp.listenEndpoint && !mcp.error', translate) Server is stopped or managed by the main window.

.alert.alert-danger(*ngIf='mcp.error', role='alert') {{mcp.error | translate}}
.alert.alert-danger(*ngIf='error', role='alert') {{error | translate}}
.alert.alert-info(*ngIf='!mcp.isMainWindow', translate) MCP runs in the main window. Unlock the vault in that window before connecting an agent.
.alert.alert-info(*ngIf='!vault.isEnabled()', translate) Configure the vault in Vault settings before creating tokens.
.alert.alert-info(*ngIf='vault.isEnabled() && !vault.isOpen()')
    p(translate) Unlock the vault to allow MCP requests. Requests are rejected while it is locked.
    button.btn.btn-secondary(type='button', (click)='unlockVault()', [disabled]='busy || !mcp.isMainWindow', translate) Unlock vault

section
    .section-heading
        .header
            h4(translate) Tokens
            p.text-muted.mb-0(translate) Each token has its own tool capabilities and access permissions.
        button.btn.btn-primary(type='button', (click)='openEditor()', [disabled]='busy || editorOpen || !vault.isEnabled() || !!createdToken', translate) Create token
    p.text-muted(translate) Use Authorization: Bearer TOKEN when connecting an agent. Each token has its own tools and connection access.
    .alert.alert-warning(*ngIf='invalidTokenRecords', translate) MCP token records are invalid. Review them in the configuration file.
    .alert.alert-warning(*ngIf='createdToken', role='status')
        p(translate) Copy this token now. It will only be shown once.
        code.d-block.text-break.selectable {{createdToken}}
        button.btn.btn-secondary.mt-2(type='button', (click)='copy(createdToken!)', translate) Copy token
        button.btn.btn-primary.mt-2.ms-2(type='button', (click)='createdToken = null', translate) Done
    .mcp-section.token-list
        p.text-muted.p-3.mb-0(*ngIf='!tokenRows.length', translate) No tokens yet.
        .token-row(*ngFor='let row of tokenRows; trackBy: trackTokenRow', [class.token-disabled]='!tokenEnabled(row.token)')
            .token-details
                .token-name {{tokenLabel(row.token)}}
                code.text-muted(*ngIf='row.token.name && row.token.preview') {{row.token.preview}}
                .token-summary.text-muted
                    span(translate='Capabilities: {count} / {total}', [translateParams]='{count: row.capabilityCount, total: toolCount}')
                    button.btn.btn-link.connection-count(type='button', (click)='openEditor(row.token, true)', [disabled]='busy || editorOpen || !!createdToken', translate='Included connections: {count}', [translateParams]='{count: row.includedConnectionCount}')
                p.text-warning.mt-2.mb-0(*ngIf='row.invalidPermissions', translate) MCP permissions are invalid. Configure this token again before use.
            .token-actions
                label.token-state
                    .form-check.form-switch
                        input.form-check-input(#tokenState='ngModel', type='checkbox', role='switch', [ngModel]='tokenEnabled(row.token)', (ngModelChange)='setTokenEnabled(row.token, $event, tokenState)', [disabled]='busy || editorOpen || !!createdToken', [attr.aria-label]='tokenEnabledLabel | translate: {name: tokenLabel(row.token)}')
                    span(*ngIf='tokenEnabled(row.token)', translate) Enabled
                    span.text-muted(*ngIf='!tokenEnabled(row.token)', translate) Disabled
                button.btn.btn-secondary(type='button', (click)='openEditor(row.token)', [disabled]='busy || editorOpen || !!createdToken', translate) View details
                button.btn.btn-danger(type='button', (click)='removeToken(row.token)', [disabled]='busy || editorOpen', translate) Revoke
